{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "center",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "# Iron Log\nGym-training PWA going multi-user.\n**Top priority:** no lost workout.",
   "x": -190,
   "y": -90,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 180,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "r0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Product & features",
   "x": 330,
   "y": -1238,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 70,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r0n0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Five tabs**: Board \u00b7 Daily \u00b7 Progress \u00b7 Program \u00b7 Settings",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -1666,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r0n1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Weekly board**: 7 columns. Card day = program day \u2192 moved \u2192 swapped order \u2192 rest-day shift",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -1548,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r0n2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Logging**: a check-off writes an `auto` entry; a hand-logged session replaces it; undo restores both",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -1404,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r0n3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Training logic**: 5 phases, targets, progression, stall, back-off, repeat-day suggestions (`planFix`)",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -1260,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r0n4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Also**: stretches, supplements & water, medical, body weight, timers, muscle map",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -1116,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r0n5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "[[iron-log/docs/feature-map|feature map]] \u00b7 21 documented conflicts (C1\u2013C21)",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -972,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r0n6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "New accounts start clean: [[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/016-new-account-starting-state|ADR 016]]",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -854,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Client (PWA)",
   "x": 330,
   "y": -353,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 70,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1n0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "React 19 + Vite PWA, installed on the phone",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -650,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1n1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "TypeScript `strict` ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/005-language-typescript-node|ADR 005]])",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -532,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1n2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Works offline ~2 days: persisted save queue, replay on reconnect",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -388,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1n3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`src/shared/` holds framework-free code used by client and `server/` ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/015-shared-code-layout|ADR 015]])",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -270,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 140,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "r1n4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Release flag **API sync** (`VITE_API_SYNC`); admin-only feature registry (`src/features.ts`)",
   "x": 670,
   "y": -100,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Sync",
   "x": 330,
   "y": 434,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 70,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2n0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Server-versioned rows, per-user `seq` cursor ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/003-sync-versioned-rows|ADR 003]])",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 104,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2n1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Tombstones (`deleted_at`) so a merge tells *removed* from *never seen*",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 248,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2n2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Stale edit refused; server returns the current row",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 366,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2n3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "One **command** per user action, one transaction, cross-row rules enforced there",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 484,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2n4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Refused write is quarantined on device, visible and exportable, **never dropped**",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 602,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "r2n5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`import-legacy`: one-time upload, empty account only, dedupe by client id",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 746,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "r3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Backend API",
   "x": 330,
   "y": 1260,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 70,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "r3n0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Own API in Docker, not Firebase/Supabase ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/001-backend-shape|ADR 001]])",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 924,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "r3n1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Express 5, thin routes ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/007-web-framework-express|ADR 007]])",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 1068,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "r3n2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Command endpoints over JSON HTTP + one pull endpoint ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/008-api-style-commands-json-http|ADR 008]])",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 1212,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 140,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "r3n3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Kysely, raw `sql` escape hatch, generated types ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/009-data-access-kysely|ADR 009]])",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 1382,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 140,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "r3n4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Server is authoritative: re-validates every rule in [[iron-log/docs/backend-data-rules|data rules]]",
   "x": 670,
   "y": 1552,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "l0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Data (Neon Postgres)",
   "x": -580,
   "y": -1166,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 70,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "l0n0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Neon Postgres, database-first ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/002-datastore-neon-postgres|ADR 002]])",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -1646,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "l0n1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "13 tables: users, config, programs, library_items, log_entries, body_entries, weeks, stretch_weeks, list_items, supplement_days, row_history, refused_writes, share_grants \u00b7 [[iron-log/docs/data-model/iron-log|data model]]",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -1502,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 192,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "l0n2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`jsonb` for config, programs, week maps, per-set detail; each has `schema_version`",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -1280,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "l0n3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "dbmate plain-SQL migrations ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/012-migrations-dbmate|ADR 012]])",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -1136,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "l0n4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Weights stored in pounds, `numeric` 4 dp ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/006-weight-unit-canonical-lb|ADR 006]])",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -992,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "l0n5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Local calendar dates, Sunday-start week ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/011-date-and-week-policy|ADR 011]])",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -848,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "l0n6",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`row_history` filled by one trigger; \u226590 days kept",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -704,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "l1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Auth & security",
   "x": -580,
   "y": -255,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 70,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l1n0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Better Auth in our API, Google login first ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/004-auth-better-auth|ADR 004]])",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -526,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l1n1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Flat ownership; Postgres **row-level security** on `user_id`",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -382,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l1n2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "API connects as non-owner `ironlog_app`; refuses to run as owner in production",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -264,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l1n3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "CSRF guard + `Secure` `HttpOnly` `SameSite` cookies; same origin so no CORS",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -146,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l1n4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "[[iron-log/docs/security-audit/run-1/REPORT|Security audit run-1]]: no critical/high/medium; 2 low, 5 open leads",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": -28,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Hosting & ops",
   "x": -580,
   "y": 473,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 70,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2n0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Google Cloud Run serves API + PWA on one origin ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/010-hosting-cloud-run|ADR 010]])",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 176,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2n1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "`max-instances=1` + budget alert as the spend guard; Render free as fallback",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 320,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2n2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "[[iron-log/docs/deploy-runbook|Deploy runbook]] + `scripts/deploy-cloud-run.sh`",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 438,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2n3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Cloud Logging + own client-error endpoint ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/013-error-reporting-cloud-logging|ADR 013]])",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 556,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 140,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l2n4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Backups: scheduled `pg_dump`, rehearsed restore; jobs for history pruning & tombstone purge",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 726,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Quality & process",
   "x": -580,
   "y": 1253,
   "width": 250,
   "height": 70,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3n0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Vitest + real Postgres in a throwaway container ([[iron-log/docs/architecture/decisions/014-backend-test-tooling|ADR 014]])",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 930,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 140,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3n1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Playwright e2e + axe accessibility checks",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 1100,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 88,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3n2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "[[iron-log/docs/architecture/failure-modes/sync|Failure-mode register]]: FM-01\u202624, hub is FM-02 (queue drops a write)",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 1218,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3n3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Reconciliation invariant: after flush + pull, phone rows == server rows; \u22641 check-off per card & week",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 1362,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 114,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "l3n4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Docs: [[iron-log/docs/architecture/stack-walkthrough|stack walkthrough]] \u00b7 [[iron-log/docs/build-spec|build spec]] \u00b7 [[iron-log/docs/backlog|backlog]]",
   "x": -1030,
   "y": 1506,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 140,
   "color": "6"
  }
 ],
